Dialogue: 30,0:00:08.59,0:00:12.40,Dialogue Italics,,0,0,0,,300 kms east of Amami Ooshima, heading northeast.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:12.90,0:00:15.47,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We've liberated Guam and Okinawa,
Dialogue: 30,0:00:15.47,0:00:18.37,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,and are now getting closer to the Japanese mainland.
Dialogue: 30,0:00:18.92,0:00:20.84,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It's finally time for the mainland battle!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:20.84,0:00:24.08,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We {\i1}will{\i0} take back our home, Japan, back!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:24.33,0:00:26.42,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Our target is the capital, Tokyo.
