Dialogue: 30,0:02:01.35,0:02:05.02,Dialogue Top,K,0,0,0,,On Wednesdays and Fridays, the beef bowls at the cafeteria have less sauce.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:05.40,0:02:07.57,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,And on Thursdays, the portions are smaller.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:07.57,0:02:11.78,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,If you overlap the part-timers' shifts, like this,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:12.28,0:02:15.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,you'll see that when Suzuki-san is working you get extra sauce,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:15.49,0:02:16.53,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,but when Yamamoto-san is working—
Dialogue: 30,0:02:16.53,0:02:18.03,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,No one cares.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:18.41,0:02:21.54,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,There's other stuff you could present, right?\N Like, you know, {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:22.25,0:02:26.17,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Oh, I figured this would be more interesting, though.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:26.17,0:02:28.42,Dialogue,All,0,0,0,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:30.21,0:02:31.05,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:31.05,0:02:32.17,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:43.18,0:02:45.06,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,These are life-sized data models
Dialogue: 30,0:02:45.52,0:02:48.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,made from my observations and analysis while performing Heart Hybrids
Dialogue: 30,0:02:48.69,0:02:50.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,during live combat.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:52.78,0:02:55.95,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The models use log data from the love room.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:55.95,0:02:58.32,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,They're more than 97 percent accurate.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:00.24,0:03:02.04,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This is an erogenous zone map
Dialogue: 30,0:03:02.04,0:03:06.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,created using data of the girls' responses to our activities during Heart Hybrids.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:06.08,0:03:08.42,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Erogenous zones?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:08.42,0:03:09.50,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,I don't know what those are!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.67,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,But still, they sound amazing! {Ed: Think this flows a bit better, but left an alt in case.}{alt: I don't know what they are, but they sound amazing!}
Dialogue: 30,0:03:11.67,0:03:14.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,However, those responses are variable.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:15.09,0:03:19.22,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The way they feel can vary greatly depending on the strength used and the friction coefficients.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:19.22,0:03:21.43,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Hida Kizuna is a terrifying man!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:21.43,0:03:24.56,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Just how much experience does he have?!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:24.56,0:03:26.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The girls' psychological states,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:27.85,0:03:31.11,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,as well as the situations you set, also change things drastically.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:31.11,0:03:34.19,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Individuals all react differently, \Nso there's no general methodology.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:34.19,0:03:36.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Each case requires unique judgment.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:36.78,0:03:38.53,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,I'm totally lost!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:38.53,0:03:40.49,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But there's something even more important.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:40.49,0:03:41.70,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:41.70,0:03:43.99,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,To understand the girl's feelings.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:44.62,0:03:46.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What they want.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:46.25,0:03:48.04,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What they're looking for.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:48.04,0:03:51.75,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You need to sense that and choose the appropriate methods.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:51.75,0:03:53.46,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,He's no amateur!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:53.46,0:03:54.17,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,He's a pro!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:54.17,0:03:55.59,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Pro Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:55.59,0:03:56.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For example...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:58.34,0:04:02.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,This is footage taken of Himekawa during our attack on the Super-Category Class, Tri-Head.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:06.68,0:04:08.02,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What the hell...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:08.02,0:04:10.48,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,are you doing?!
