Dialogue: 30,0:04:34.42,0:04:37.09,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,You're enjoying yourselves a bit too much, you idiots.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:43.43,0:04:47.02,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I've finished presenting my science project for the first day of the Academy Festa...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:49.35,0:04:51.73,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll go check out what everyone's up to.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.78,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Well? Did you find her?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:04.78,0:05:06.66,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,No, I looked everywhere.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:06.66,0:05:09.33,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We can't do our rehearsal like this.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:09.33,0:05:12.58,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Jeez, where did she go?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:12.58,0:05:13.79,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:13.79,0:05:14.96,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.67,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Julicia-san,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.88,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,don't just cling onto him every time you see him!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:19.88,0:05:21.97,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Oh, did you get hurt?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:25.56,0:05:26.72,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:26.72,0:05:28.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,is there a problem?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:29.56,0:05:32.52,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Didn't Hayuru {just go }tell you?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:33.10,0:05:36.02,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,K-Kizuna-kun was doing a perverted presentation!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:36.02,0:05:38.03,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I didn't have time to tell him!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:38.53,0:05:40.15,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,It's time for rehearsal,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:40.15,0:05:41.61,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,but there's no sign of Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:41.61,0:05:42.53,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.87,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,We had everyone go look for her,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:45.87,0:05:47.54,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,but nobody could find her.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:47.99,0:05:49.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You try using the PA system?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:49.29,0:05:52.00,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,{\q2}We sure did. We made an Ataraxia-wide announcement.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:52.00,0:05:53.25,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,But no luck.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.67,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,She's either asleep or hiding.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.17,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:57.17,0:05:58.75,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'll go look.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:58.75,0:06:01.05,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You two start the rehearsal without her.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:05.85,0:06:09.77,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But how am I supposed to find her in this crowd?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:11.43,0:06:14.56,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Huh, if it isn't Mister Kizuna?{Hey, it's Mister Kizuna.}
Dialogue: 30,0:06:14.56,0:06:16.31,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:16.69,0:06:17.98,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Gertrude!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:18.86,0:06:20.82,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're okay now?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.90,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I sure am.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:22.90,0:06:27.45,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,No way in hell am I spending the festival in bed.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:28.24,0:06:29.95,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Well, don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:29.95,0:06:31.45,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:31.45,0:06:33.21,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Have you seen Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:34.62,0:06:37.25,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I tried every food stall out here...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:38.00,0:06:40.34,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,but no, I haven't seen her.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.72,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Maybe in the school building?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:42.97,0:06:44.22,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:44.22,0:06:45.18,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:55.60,0:06:56.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:56.81,0:06:59.90,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,but have you seen Chidorigafuchi Aine from Class 2-A?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.28,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's Eros!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:05.82,0:07:06.78,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's really him!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:06.78,0:07:08.91,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Run, everyone!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:09.33,0:07:10.70,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:12.20,0:07:13.12,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:13.12,0:07:14.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I don't—
Dialogue: 30,0:07:16.83,0:07:19.46,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:19.46,0:07:21.75,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you doing here, Captain?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:21.75,0:07:22.84,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:22.84,0:07:23.55,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.76,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,This is Sylvia's class!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:26.76,0:07:29.05,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,But, where did everyone go?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:29.64,0:07:31.64,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Uh, the thing is...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:37.77,0:07:38.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:38.81,0:07:39.77,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I need a favor.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:42.53,0:07:46.11,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Just in case we can't find Aine,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:46.11,0:07:47.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I brought you a substitute.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:48.66,0:07:50.20,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,You mean Sylvia?!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:50.70,0:07:54.25,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Kizuna-kun, that's not fair to Sylvia-chan—
Dialogue: 30,0:07:54.25,0:07:57.71,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Sylvia-chan, let's go practice a little.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:57.71,0:07:59.33,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Julicia-san?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.96,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,S-Sylvia can't! It's too sudden!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:02.75,0:08:05.30,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'll keep looking for Aine, then.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:05.30,0:08:06.59,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Bye! {alt: We're counting on you!}
Dialogue: 30,0:08:06.59,0:08:07.84,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Captain!
