Dialogue: 30,0:08:17.27,0:08:22.86,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,There's currently no queue to test-fire\N the Engineering Division's latest railgun!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:23.19,0:08:24.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Kurumizawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:24.23,0:08:25.40,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Eros Overlord!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:25.99,0:08:26.90,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:26.90,0:08:29.11,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,My name is Hida Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:29.41,0:08:31.16,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What's your problem? That was a compliment.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:31.16,0:08:32.12,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It was not!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:32.70,0:08:36.29,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That aside, have you seen Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:36.29,0:08:38.16,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Chidorigafuchi-san?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:38.16,0:08:39.75,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,No, I haven't seen her come by.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:40.12,0:08:41.13,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:41.92,0:08:43.54,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Hey, while you're here...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:44.25,0:08:47.21,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Want to try our new railgun?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:47.21,0:08:49.59,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm kinda in a hurry...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:49.59,0:08:50.84,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Just come with me!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:51.84,0:08:55.22,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's not going to blow up on me, is it?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:55.22,0:08:56.72,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:56.72,0:09:00.64,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate Kurumizawa Momo, the Engineering Division's top student!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.98,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:02.98,0:09:05.40,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I've got stuff to do, so I'll only fire one shot.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:05.86,0:09:08.03,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's not hard to operate.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:08.03,0:09:08.90,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:09.99,0:09:11.70,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Put the target in the middle of the sights, {Ed: Is this an Evangelion reference haha?}
Dialogue: 30,0:09:11.70,0:09:12.95,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,and flip the switch.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.07,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Flipping switch!
