Dialogue: 30,0:09:26.05,0:09:29.72,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Shikina-san, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:36.47,0:09:37.97,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Uh... Never mind.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:37.97,0:09:39.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Have you seen Aine?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:47.11,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fscx99.966\xbord0\xshad0\fscy99.696\ybord0\yshad0\fnCashew Apple Ale\bord0\blur0.75\fscx179.939\fscy179.453\c&H575253&\frz6.539\frx4.008\fry1.334\pos(948,939)}Haven't seen her.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.53,0:09:51.49,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Master.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:51.74,0:09:53.99,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Huh? You're the Masters...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:54.20,0:09:56.12,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:56.12,0:09:58.49,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Did you come to see me in my maid outfit?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:59.66,0:10:01.08,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,In this café,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:01.08,0:10:03.37,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,you're the master of the Masters.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:03.79,0:10:06.88,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Order a lot, okay, Master?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.00,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:13.55,0:10:16.85,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What will you order, Master?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:16.85,0:10:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:18.35,0:10:21.35,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm not here for tea.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.89,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm looking for Aine.
