Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:48.09,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fnAboutface\blur1.14\fscx164.76\fscy164.76\c&H302C29&\frz358.6\fax-0.2\fs75\pos(772.65,1083.945)}Charges
Dialogue: 30,0:10:48.38,0:10:49.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's expensive!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:49.63,0:10:51.55,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It includes an information fee.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:51.55,0:10:52.72,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:52.72,0:10:55.09,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,550)}You didn't give me any information, though...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:58.60,0:11:01.18,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's almost time for the concert.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.60,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Seriously, where did she go?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:21.20,0:11:23.37,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,If you want to kill me, then do it now!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:23.83,0:11:26.62,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,General Grabel of the 6th Expeditionary Force.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:27.33,0:11:31.38,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You've gone from hero to traitor.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:31.63,0:11:35.88,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,She decided on her own to make contact with the Lemurian barbarians,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:36.43,0:11:39.97,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,did not report the discovery of the Zeros,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:39.97,0:11:43.39,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,and then tried to keep it a secret, what a traitor.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:45.56,0:11:46.94,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Zeros is in Lemuria?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:48.27,0:11:50.15,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Put together a fleet immediately!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:50.86,0:11:54.65,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Capture Zeros even if it means killing every single Lemurian!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:55.15,0:11:58.32,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,We've conquered more than enough of Lemuria!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:58.32,0:12:00.82,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,What's the point of more murder?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:01.33,0:12:04.24,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,There are civilians there, not just soldiers!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:06.37,0:12:07.83,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:08.21,0:12:10.96,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Compared to what we seek,
Dialogue: 30,0:12:10.96,0:12:12.71,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,their lives are meaningless.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:13.67,0:12:18.05,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I was originally a soldier of a country that was conquered by Batlantis.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:36.44,0:12:38.74,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,S-Stop it!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:44.37,0:12:46.58,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,I can't allow you to invade...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:46.58,0:12:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or oppress them for no reason...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:52.71,0:12:54.63,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I won't kill you.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:54.63,0:12:58.72,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll send you to heaven without needing to.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:10.44,0:13:13.31,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:16.28,0:13:17.40,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:17.40,0:13:19.99,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,I should only feel hate and pain,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:19.99,0:13:21.57,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,so why do I feel so...?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:39.17,0:13:40.63,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:52.52,0:13:53.85,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:53.85,0:13:55.44,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Giving in already?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:55.90,0:13:57.23,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,Endure.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:57.23,0:13:59.23,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,Aldea will come for you.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:59.94,0:14:01.15,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:03.36,0:14:07.83,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You think your friend will come for you?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:20.51,0:14:22.72,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Zelshione-sama!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:22.72,0:14:25.72,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Please, give me more love!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:26.30,0:14:27.43,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:27.43,0:14:30.72,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm your pet, after all!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:31.18,0:14:33.73,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Mind control...?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:34.06,0:14:35.77,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:35.77,0:14:39.19,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll make you my pet, as well,
Dialogue: 30,0:14:39.19,0:14:40.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bronze Beast.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:42.69,0:14:45.99,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,First, you're going to tell me where Zeros is.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:55.92,0:14:57.63,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,We're going to Lemuria.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:57.63,0:15:00.13,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Our target is their mobile fortress.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:02.17,0:15:05.13,Dialogue,Nayuta,0,0,0,,Please wait a moment, Zelshione-sama.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:05.51,0:15:07.14,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're...
