Dialogue: 30,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.73,Dialogue Top,Gu,0,0,0,,Now, it's time for a special Academy Festa performance!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:19.73,0:15:21.32,Dialogue Top,Gu,0,0,0,,They're usually a combat group,
Dialogue: 30,0:15:21.32,0:15:22.78,Dialogue Top,Gu,0,0,0,,but just for today...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:22.78,0:15:25.78,Dialogue Top,Gu,0,0,0,,they're school idols!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:25.78,0:15:27.78,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No sign of Aine-san...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:28.24,0:15:30.28,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Let's go, Sylvia!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:30.91,0:15:33.29,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,S-Sylvia will do her best!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:33.70,0:15:38.42,Dialogue,Gu,0,0,0,,Give a big hand to the idols of Ataraxia, Amaterasu!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:44.30,0:15:45.92,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,It's already started, huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:46.84,0:15:49.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Just where did she go?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:51.22,0:15:54.35,Dialogue Top,Y,0,0,0,,Hi, everybody!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:53.06,0:15:54.98,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Something was bothering her.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:55.93,0:15:58.10,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,What's going on in her head?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:58.85,0:16:01.02,Dialogue Top,H,0,0,0,,G-Good evening!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:01.02,0:16:03.82,Dialogue Top,S,0,0,0,,Please excuse Sylvia! She's standing in for Aine-senpai!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:04.65,0:16:05.69,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Sylvia...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:05.69,0:16:07.78,Dialogue Top,S,0,0,0,,I'm Sylvia Silkcut!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:08.45,0:16:09.78,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Is she going to be okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:14.49,0:16:15.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:17.92,0:16:18.92,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:23.09,0:16:26.22,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Okay, everybody, here we go!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:35.10,0:16:38.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Why are you sitting here by yourself?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:38.85,0:16:40.48,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I told you before, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:41.19,0:16:44.44,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That each time I do a Heart Hybrid, some of my memories come back?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:45.11,0:16:45.86,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:45.86,0:16:50.36,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But, I think they may not be memories.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.37,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:52.91,0:16:56.75,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I searched the database for the things I saw.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:57.54,0:17:01.38,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But they don't exist anywhere on Earth.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:01.63,0:17:04.13,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,It's like they're from another world...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:05.88,0:17:09.51,Dialogue Song,Y,0,0,0,,Don't think too hard!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:09.51,0:17:11.84,Dialogue Song,Y,0,0,0,,Take back hope!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:13.64,0:17:16.77,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Another... world...?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:17.56,0:17:18.35,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:19.64,0:17:21.98,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't want to remember anymore.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:21.98,0:17:25.36,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,So I'm not going to do any more Heart Hybrids.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:25.77,0:17:29.74,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But your Hybrid Count's getting low.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:30.32,0:17:33.16,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,If you don't do one, your count will drop to zero in the next fight—
Dialogue: 30,0:17:33.16,0:17:34.24,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:34.57,0:17:35.62,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:36.24,0:17:38.87,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't want to remember any more strange things!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:39.20,0:17:43.50,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I feel like if I do, I won't be the same person anymore.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:44.33,0:17:45.13,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.21,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:48.21,0:17:50.13,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, you'll still be Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:50.47,0:17:51.63,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:12.28,0:18:13.41,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Kizuna...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:16.07,0:18:19.08,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,No matter what's in your past, I...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:19.08,0:18:20.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,We won't change our minds.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:21.25,0:18:23.04,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You'll always be one of us.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:24.67,0:18:25.92,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,To me,
Dialogue: 30,0:18:26.46,0:18:29.30,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,you'll always be Chidorigafuchi Aine, no one else.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:31.80,0:18:35.05,Dialogue Song,Gi,0,0,0,,I'll shoot you through!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:35.05,0:18:38.30,Dialogue Song,Gi,0,0,0,,A burning hot gaze...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:38.30,0:18:43.56,Dialogue Song,Gi,0,0,0,,Get closer to me and make it so you're only mine.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:43.56,0:18:45.81,Dialogue Song,Gi,0,0,0,,My heart's beating so fast.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:47.02,0:18:47.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:06.50,0:19:07.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Don't hide them.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:07.71,0:19:10.17,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,But I'm embarrassed...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:18.80,0:19:20.47,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Does it feel good?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:20.47,0:19:22.35,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,D-Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:26.44,0:19:28.11,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You already know...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:35.45,0:19:36.91,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:43.58,0:19:45.87,Dialogue Song,Singers,0,0,0,,Love Gun High Power!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:23.95,0:20:25.95,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:31.42,0:20:32.21,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:35.59,0:20:36.55,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:38.47,0:20:44.47,Dialogue Song,Singers,0,0,0,,Seven loves shooting through the heart!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:53.77,0:20:58.20,Dialogue,S,0,0,0,,Captain, Sylvia performed and scored!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:06.16,0:21:07.12,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:08.08,0:21:09.37,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Kizuna!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:09.37,0:21:11.75,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Amaterasu needs to scramble immediately.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:12.33,0:21:14.29,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,An enemy fleet has appeared.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:15.59,0:21:19.76,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,The enemy fleet has come from the Kanto area of Japan.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:23.22,0:21:25.10,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,If we want to take back Tokyo,
Dialogue: 30,0:21:25.10,0:21:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we'll have to fight them eventually.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:27.64,0:21:28.43,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:30.56,0:21:31.69,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:31.69,0:21:32.81,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Someone's there!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:43.41,0:21:44.78,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Why is she there?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:46.79,0:21:47.83,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:51.71,0:21:53.83,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Kizuna.
